Data notice

The MIT licence above covers the code, documentation and analysis outputs
written for this project. It does not cover data derived from ForecastBench.

Files derived from the ForecastBench human-round datasets
(https://github.com/forecastingresearch/forecastbench-datasets, commit 203a0d1)
are adapted material under the Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike 4.0
International licence (CC BY-SA 4.0, https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/).
These include data/processed/ and the panels, manifests, prompts and model
responses under results/ that reproduce forecasts or question text.
Original data: Forecasting Research Institute, ForecastBench (Karger et al.).
Changes: questions filtered, forecasts scored, and forecasters resampled into
panels, as described in docs/ and scripts/.
